1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,604
It stays a tadpole and keeps growing.

2
00:00:02,604 --> 00:00:09,674
Without iodine the thyroid cannot make thyroxine, and without thyroxine there is no metamorphosis.

3
00:00:09,674 --> 00:00:15,117
Early metamorphosis is what extra thyroxine causes, the opposite case.

